W1-T39's change to W1-T21's fixture family, applied on 2026-10-25, when this round of W1 permitted W1-T39 to make it.
GEN-fixture's t3 dp:Z5 mutant "drop a conjunct" was always the shortest option, a length cue GATE-items found (the
shipped-cue step of RUN-items-gate puts it back and the gate fails it), so "flip the connective only" (dp:G5) replaces
it and the framework README stops listing dp:Z5 among the fixture's tags. scripts/spikes/W1-T21/record.mjs then
re-recorded determinism.json in Node, Chromium, Firefox and WebKit (RUN-generators-gate): t3's digests and the family
digest changed, t1's and t2's did not. Kept as the record of the change for the owner's review of W1-T21; it is applied.

